// TITAN COMPILER BACKEND - IR LOWERING, MACHINE CODE GENERATION, REGISTER ALLOCATION
// Complete SSA IR model, x86-64 & ARM64 encoding, register allocation, binary generation
// Language: TITAN (Systems Programming)
// Phase 5: Compiler Ecosystem - Backend
